data: {"agent":"coordinator","agent_tab":"coordinator","event":{"output":"{\"content\":\"# Self-Evolution Live Monitor — Reusable Procedure Capture 37 (Stricter Lifecycle-Variance Re-Run)\\n\\n**Run:** 37 | **Previous:** Run 36 (app_scoped_routing_recheck) | **Type:** Reusable-procedure capture re-run with stricter lifecycle-variance checks  \\n**Method:** Canonical app-scoped Skill operations route `/api/apps/a9435a4b-d123-5a4c-b0b7-d9b1342089ea/skills/operations` before/after; terminal execution evidence; application-neutral generic observations only  \\n**Constraint:** No proposals promoted/rejected/merged/mutated. No `available_skills/` modified. No mission-state edited. No registries, no catalog files mutated.  \\n**Stricter Checks Added vs Run 33:** (1) Full field-level variance matrix per proposal, (2) per-proposal_id lifecycle delta tracking, (3) `mutated` flag monitoring per API section, (4) bounded_summary/proposal_id cross-reference audit, (5) processing.state_counts lane-by-lane confirmation, (6) semantic review availability check\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 0. Exact Commands Used\\n\\n```bash\\n# === BEFORE SNAPSHOT (canonical route) ===\\ncurl -s http://localhost:3001/api/apps/a9435a4b-d123-5a4c-b0b7-d9b1342089ea/skills/operations > /tmp/macaca-skills-ops-before-run37.json\\n\\n# === GOVERNANCE COUNT ===\\nls shared/self_evolution_*.md | wc -l      # 36\\ncat shared/self_evolution_*.md | wc -l     # 7258\\n\\n# === VERIFICATION ARTIFACT COUNT ===\\nls agents/coordinator/*verify* shared/live-loop* shared/self_evol_4* 2>/dev/null | wc -l  # 6\\n\\n# === MISSION-STATE INVARIANTS ===\\npython3 -c \\\"\\nimport sys,json\\nms=json.load(open('shared/.omc/state/mission-state.json'))\\nfor m in ms['missions']:\\n    for a in m['agents']:\\n        print(f\\\\\\\"{a['name']}: completedSummary={a.get('completedSummary')} mission_name={m.get('name','?')}\\\\\\\")\\n\\\"  # All 5: completedSummary=None mission_name=none\\n\\n# === LIFECYCLE/CLASSIFICATION/ROUTING INVARIANTS (BEFORE) ===\\npython3 -c \\\"\\nimport json\\nd = json.load(open('/tmp/macaca-skills-ops-before-run37.json'))\\nps = d['prop...[truncated, 28691 bytes]","tool_name":"file_read","type":"tool_result"},"task_id":"ba49bb25-b709-467e-849f-528fdb4c5f12"}

