data: {"agent":"coordinator","agent_tab":"coordinator","event":{"output":"{\"cwd\":\"/Users/quantum/.macaca/workspaces/a9435a4b-d123-5a4c-b0b7-d9b1342089ea\",\"exit_code\":0,\"stderr\":\"\",\"stdout\":\"/Users/quantum/.macaca/workspaces/a9435a4b-d123-5a4c-b0b7-d9b1342089ea/shared/self_evolution_live_reuse_check_c.md\\n# Self-Evolution Live Reuse Check C — Telemetry-Optimization & Materialization-Activation-Telemetry-Registry\\n\\n**Date:** 2026-05-25  \\n**Method:** Bounded filesystem inspection. No mutation of any file. Application-agnostic.  \\n**Core question:** 对前两轮产物（runbook_0、gap_triage_1、checklist_2）中定义的模式进行 live reuse 验证，聚焦两类已沉淀 skill：`telemetry-optimization` 和 `materialization-activation-telemetry-registry`，记录复用证据、优化/合并/归档发现。\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. 已复用的 Workspace Skill 清单\\n\\n本次验证复用以下 workspace skill（通过 `file_read` + `shell` 命令读取，非 runtime 激活）：\\n\\n### 1.1 显式 Skill 定义（`skills/` 与 `available_skills/` 双位置）\\n\\n| Skill 名称 | 位置（skills/） | 位置（available_skills/） | 内容一致？ | _meta.json 存在？ |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| `telemetry-optimization` | ✅ `/skills/telemetry-optimization/SKILL.md` | ✅ `/available_skills/telemetry_optimization/SKILL.md` | **是（完全一致）** | ❌ 均缺失 |\\n| `materialization-activation-telemetry-registry` | ✅ `/skills/materialization-activation-telemetry-registry/SKILL.md` | ✅ `/available_skills/materialization_activation_telemetry_registry/SKILL.md` | **是（完全一致）** | ❌ 均缺失 |\\n| `materialization-proposal-linked-skill-package-registry-load-path` | ✅ `/skills/.../SKILL.md` | ❌ 不存在 | — | ❌ |\\n| `materialization-skill-package-registry-load-path-usage-telemetry` | ✅ `/skills/.../SKILL.md` | ❌ 不存在 | — | ❌ |\\n\\n### 1.2 隐式复用的前两轮产物（governance artifacts）\\n\\n| 产物 | 路径 | 复用方式 |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| observation_runbook_0 | `shared/self_evolution_observat...[truncated, 2531 bytes]","tool_name":"shell","type":"tool_result"},"task_id":"ba49bb25-b709-467e-849f-528fdb4c5f12"}

