e Run 35\\n- `/api/apps/*/skills/operations` — returns 0 proposals from thi...[truncated, 16224 bytes]","tool_name":"file_read","type":"tool_result"},"task_id":"ba49bb25-b709-467e-849f-528fdb4c5f12"}

